MID_LGV_Scout_Dai_m04_002: You got a good eye if you're talking to me!
MID_LGV_Scout_Dai_m04_003: But I have to protect my woman, Anatolia. So, bye!
MID_LGV_Scout_Dai_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Dai_m05_001: You got something to say to me? What a wild\ncoincidence! I've got things to say to you!
MID_LGV_Scout_Dai_m05_002: No matter how many times I tell Anatolia she's my\nwoman, she doesn't believe me.
MID_LGV_Scout_Dai_m05_003: So I'm going to get more manly and strong in secret.\nOnce I do that, she's sure to notice me!
MID_LGV_Scout_Dai_m05_004: You're a pretty strong guy. I bet I'll get a lot stronger\nif me and you fight!
MID_LGV_Scout_Dai_m05_005: You're pretty strong. I bet I'll get a lot stronger if me\nand you fight!
MID_LGV_Scout_Dai_m05_006: OK, you make a good offer. I'm all yours.
MID_LGV_Scout_Dai_m06: <TH>
