MID_LGV_Scout_Dai_m06_002: I don't know what you're fighting for, but you can \ncount on me to do a great job helping.
MID_LGV_Scout_Dai_m06_003: I don't know what you're fighting for, but you can \ncount on me to do a great job helping.
