MID_LGV_Scout_Hal_m02_001: You picked me! That's so neat! Thank you!
MID_LGV_Scout_Hal_m02_002: You picked me! That's so neat! Thank you!
MID_LGV_Scout_Hal_m02_003: Hang on, am I suddenly the one doing the asking?
MID_LGV_Scout_Hal_m03: <TH>
