MID_LGV_Scout_Hal_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Hal_m04_001: Anatolia helped me out, and I'm really grateful to her\nbecause of that.
MID_LGV_Scout_Hal_m04_002: Anatolia helped me out, and I'm really grateful to her\nbecause of that.
MID_LGV_Scout_Hal_m04_003: So that's why I can't go with you. But if you wanna\nsee a performance, come to any one of my shows!
MID_LGV_Scout_Hal_m04_004: So that's why I can't go with you. But if you wanna\nsee a performance, come to any one of my shows!
MID_LGV_Scout_Hal_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Hal_m05_001: You want me to join your team?! Me? Are you\nmaybe confusing me with somebody else?
MID_LGV_Scout_Hal_m05_002: You want me to join your team?! Me? Are you\nmaybe confusing me with somebody else?
MID_LGV_Scout_Hal_m05_003: But I'm not all that good at fighting. I kinda always\nrely on Anatolia...
MID_LGV_Scout_Hal_m05_004: But I'm not all that good at fighting. I kinda always\nrely on Anatolia...
MID_LGV_Scout_Hal_m05_005: Is that not enough? If I were strong, could I have\nmaybe helped them?
MID_LGV_Scout_Hal_m05_006: If I help you, do you think I'll get strong enough that\nI can protect the people I care about?
MID_LGV_Scout_Hal_m05_007: If I help you, do you think I'll get strong enough that\nI can protect the people I care about?
MID_LGV_Scout_Hal_m05_008: C-can I ask you about payment? I dunno the going\nrate, but... Maybe about this much, maybe?
