MID_LGV_Scout_Hal_m06_002: Why does it seem like I've maybe ended up being the\none asking for help?
MID_LGV_Scout_Hal_m06_003: Anyway, I'm looking forward to working with you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Hal_m06_004: Anyway, I'm looking forward to working with you.
