MID_LGV_Scout_Hal_m08_002: It's not enough. Too expensive, maybe?!
MID_LGV_Scout_Guj_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Guj_m01_001: I knew today was gonna get interesting. This will\nbe the start of some epic times!
MID_LGV_Scout_Guj_m01_002: Oh, Queen Theodora! You must want to add me\nto your brigade!
MID_LGV_Scout_Guj_m01_003: So you want to hire the Unkillable Guzran...
MID_LGV_Scout_Guj_m01_004: You must've heard that I'm so strong I slew a\nthousand foes at once. A single chop, all dead!
MID_LGV_Scout_Guj_m01_005: You'll be getting a whole lot of mercenary—that's for\nsure! So we gonna get this show on the road?
MID_LGV_Scout_Guj_m01_006: I'd be a hell of a recruit. Now, that was a pretty\ngood pitch, right?
MID_LGV_Scout_Guj_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Guj_m02_001: I promise this'll be a good time had by all. The\nbiggest time, the BEST time!
MID_LGV_Scout_Guj_m02_002: Just what I'd expect, Queen. You like to stand\nshoulder to shoulder with strong comrades.
