MID_LGV_Scout_Guj_m04_004: But...I'm sorry to say I don't think you can keep up\nwith me. I'll be around once you can though.
MID_LGV_Scout_Guj_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Guj_m05_001: Looks like this could be your lucky day. I bet you're\nsomeone who goes for what they want.
MID_LGV_Scout_Guj_m05_002: Hitting me up shows that you know a good hire\nwhen you see one, Queen of the Saramis.
MID_LGV_Scout_Guj_m05_003: I just call it like I see it. And I think things could\nget really interesting with you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Guj_m05_004: I am a veteran talent around here. All the mercs in\nshouting distance owe Guzran for training 'em up.
