MID_LGV_Scout_Guj_m05_006: I'll always tell you how I see it. And what I see...\nis that it'll be more interesting with you around!
MID_LGV_Scout_Guj_m05_007: So need an ally? I'm your Guzran! And I've got a\ngreat deal going, just for you!
MID_LGV_Scout_Guj_m05_008: And I have been bored lately. Glad to join your\nbrigade. I've got a great deal going, just for you!
MID_LGV_Scout_Guj_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Guj_m06_001: I knew you'd come through. Good doing business\nwith you.
