MID_LGV_Scout_Yan_m01_001: Are you perhaps interested in making use of me\nin your battles?
MID_LGV_Scout_Yan_m01_002: Are you perhaps interested in adding me to the\nlowliest part of your entourage, Queen Theodora?
MID_LGV_Scout_Yan_m01_003: You needn't worry overly about my fee. I seek no\nexcessive reward. I fight according to fate.
MID_LGV_Scout_Yan_m01_004: You needn't worry about my scheming for higher\nrank. I know too well the peaks and valleys of power.
MID_LGV_Scout_Yan_m01_005: I do have one personal requirement. You must allow\nme free leash...to drink as I will. Haha!
MID_LGV_Scout_Yan_m01_006: I do have one personal request. You must allow me\nfree leash...to drink as I will. Haha!
