MID_LGV_Scout_Yan_m02_002: Understood! Then I will offer you my power.
MID_LGV_Scout_Yan_m02_003: I have wandered to the four corners of the world\nand stand here ready to serve!
MID_LGV_Scout_Yan_m02_004: I have wandered to the four corners of the world\nand stand here ready to serve Your Majesty!
MID_LGV_Scout_Yan_m03: <TH>
