MID_LGV_Scout_Yan_m04_002: Your offer would be generous, I'm sure, but for now,\nI find myself at leisure. Fate may pair us in time.
MID_LGV_Scout_Yan_m04_003: Your offer would be generous, but I'm not ready to\nbe tied down quite yet. Fate may pair us in time.
