MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Question03_Yan_m01_003: Tipple—whether sudsy, fizzy, or whatnot—can be\nmade from various ingredients.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Question03_Yan_m01_004: Tipple—whether sudsy, fizzy, or whatnot—can be\nmade from various ingredients, as you know.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Question03_Yan_m01_005: Tell me what my favorite beverage is made of!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Question03_Yan_m01_006: Can you guess what my favorite beverage is\nmade of?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Question03_Yan_m01_007: <ICA>Guess fruit.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Question03_Yan_m01_008: <ICB>Guess potatoes.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Question03_Yan_m01_009: <ICC>Guess honey.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Question03_Yan_m01_010: <ACA>Ah... Many such beverages can be made from\nletting fruit ferment.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Question03_Yan_m01_011: <ACA>And so, a wide world of fruit leads to a wider world\nof fermented beverages. I could pick no favorite.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Question03_Yan_m01_012: <ACA>Still! I like them equally, which makes you...correct!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Question03_Yan_m01_013: <ACB>Ah... Many such beverages can be made from the\npotato. It lacks sweetness but is a solid ladder.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Question03_Yan_m01_014: <ACB>By which I mean, its essence can be distilled into a\nspirit that climbs into the sky. Brisk, bracing, cold!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Question03_Yan_m01_015: <ACB>I like it as well as any other tipple, which makes\nyou...correct!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Question03_Yan_m01_016: <ACC>Ah... The substance from industrious bees. Well, an\nindustrious fermenter can make more from it.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Question03_Yan_m01_017: <ACC>Mead, that is—the sugars of honey transmuted by\na strange alchemy into fizz and flavor.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Question03_Yan_m01_018: <ACC>I like it as well as any other effervescent drink,\nwhich makes you...correct!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Question03_Yan_m01_019: You have gotten all the questions exactly right.\nIt's clear that you will understand me!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Question03_Yan_m01_020: Your Majesty! You have gotten all the questions\nright. It's clear that you will understand me!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Question03_Yan_m01_021: And so, I will offer you my power.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Question03_Yan_m01_022: And so, Queen Theodora, I will offer you my power.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Question03_Yan_m01_023: I have wandered to the four corners of the world\nand stand here ready to serve!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Question03_Yan_m01_024: I have wandered to the four corners of the world\nand stand here ready to serve Your Majesty!
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m01_001: Hey, how about you hire me on? I'd be glad to fight\nas part of your group.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m01_002: Your Majesty, I'm sorry to be so forward. Could you\npossibly take me into your employ?
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m01_003: Bertrand, please let me fight for you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m01_004: I'm new to this work, and I'd like to be of service,\neven while learning how to be a better fighter.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m01_005: I'm new to this work, but I'd like serve you, even\nthough I'm still learning how to be a better fighter.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m01_006: You may feel that I'm not trustworthy, given I'm\nfrom Arago. But that's exactly why I'm asking.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m02_001: What?! Thank you! Please, use me however you\nsee fit.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m02_002: Really?! Thank you! Please, employ me in any way\nyou see fit.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m03_001: Alright. Let me know if you change your mind.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m03_002: I see. That is a pity. Please don't hesitate to ask me if\nyou decide otherwise.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m04_001: I want to pledge my service, but more than that, I\nhope to find an ideal lord to serve.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m04_002: I appreciate your interest, but I suggest that you not\nbother hiring me.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m04_003: I appreciate your interest, but I suggest that you not\nbother hiring me.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m04_004: I don't know you well enough...to say if you're\nsomeone like that or not.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m04_005: I must admit that I refused to pledge myself to the\nking of my homeland. I might...refuse you too.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m04_006: I must admit that I refused to pledge myself to the\nking of my homeland. I might...refuse you too.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m05_001: I was once a knight of Arago, but my homeland\nchanged. I grew to loathe it, so I left it all behind.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m05_002: I was once a knight of Arago, but my homeland\nchanged. I grew to loathe it, so I left it all behind.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m05_003: General Bertrand? I once saw you back when I\nlived in Arago.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m05_004: I'm now trying to earn my way as a mercenary\nwhile searching for a new lord to serve.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m05_005: I'm now trying to earn my keep as a mercenary\nwhile searching for a new lord to serve.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m05_006: I used to be a knight in Arago, until it all changed.\nI came to loathe being there, so I left it behind.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m05_007: It's not like I would serve you as a lord, but I would\nsee you as an employer to dedicate myself to.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m05_008: I don't know if Your Majesty rules by ideals or\notherwise, but I have heard you are a good ruler.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m05_009: For now, I'm earning my keep as a mercenary while\nsearching for a true lord to serve.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m05_010: So this is good. As long as I get paid fairly, I'm glad\nto provide you service.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m05_011: I would gladly serve under your banner as a\nmercenary if the pay was fair for my service.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m05_012: I'm sure you have some...thoughts about that country.\nIf you can pay, I'd be glad to serve you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m05_013: My faithful steed is hungry. Can you get me this as\npart of my early salary?
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m05_014: My faithful steed is hungry. Can Your Majesty get\nme this as part of my early salary?
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m06_001: Thank you! Rocinan will appreciate this as well.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m06_002: Thank you! And allow me to give my thanks on\nbehalf of Rocinan too.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m06_003: Though I am new to this, I swear that I'll prove my\nuse to you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m06_004: Though I am new to this work, I hope you'll still use\nme in any way you see fit.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m07: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m07_001: Alright. Let me know if you change your mind.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m07_002: I see. That is a pity. Please don't hesitate to ask me if\nyou decide otherwise.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m08: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m08_001: That's not enough. I'll be here once you have it.
MID_LGV_Scout_Iio_m08_002: It seems that you don't have enough. I'll be here\nwhen you have the full amount.
MID_LGV_Scout_Pep_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Pep_m01_001: Oh! You wish to stand side by side in battle with\nthe king of Brigid, do you?
MID_LGV_Scout_Pep_m01_002: Haha! We deem it a worthy request from one who\nhas bested us in competition. So why not!
MID_LGV_Scout_Pep_m01_003: Consider our strength yours. We will champion your\nevery cause. A great honor, we're sure!
MID_LGV_Scout_Pep_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Pep_m02_001: Then your path and ours are joined as one. May the\nspirits watch over this happy union!
MID_LGV_Scout_Pep_m02_002: Then your path and ours are joined as one. The\nspirits are surely watching over you!
MID_LGV_Scout_Pep_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Pep_m03_001: Are you concerned that our radiant presence will\nshine too brightly? Fear not, if so!
MID_LGV_Scout_Noc_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Noc_m01_001: I bet you're looking for people who can fight, right?\nMy gut sense is never wrong.
MID_LGV_Scout_Noc_m01_002: If you are, I'm good as it gets. I've been working\naround here as a gladiator.
MID_LGV_Scout_Noc_m01_003: I'm proud of my strengths in battle. So how about\nit—can I join you?
MID_LGV_Scout_Noc_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Noc_m02_001: I knew it! I'm never wrong about this kind of thing.\nLet's do this!
MID_LGV_Scout_Noc_m02_002: I'm not just all talk either. I'll show you I've really\ngot what it takes.
MID_LGV_Scout_Noc_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Noc_m03_001: Huh? But my gut's never wrong... Oh well! You just\nshout if you need me.
MID_LGV_Scout_Noc_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Noc_m04_001: You know, the guy I last worked for was a real creep.\nI slugged him real good.
MID_LGV_Scout_Noc_m04_002: I've learned to question who I join up with. Thanks\nfor asking, but I need to think about it longer.
MID_LGV_Scout_Sop_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Sop_m01_001: Do you need a healer? You might think about adding\nme to your group!
MID_LGV_Scout_Sop_m01_002: Do you need a healer? You might think about adding\nme to your group!
MID_LGV_Scout_Sop_m01_003: I've been of good use with temple work, so I'm sure\nI'd do well. Pretty sure, anyway!
MID_LGV_Scout_Sop_m01_004: I'm great with temple work, so I'm sure I'd do well.\nPretty sure, anyway!
MID_LGV_Scout_Sop_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Sop_m02_001: Thank you! That'll finally earn me enough to—\nuh, nothing!
MID_LGV_Scout_Sop_m02_002: Thank you! That'll finally earn me enough to—\nuh, nothing!
MID_LGV_Scout_Sop_m02_003: I'm so happy that I can help your group, and I can't\nwait to work for you!
MID_LGV_Scout_Sop_m02_004: I'm so happy that I can help your group, and I\npromise that I'll do my very best!
MID_LGV_Scout_Sop_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Sop_m03_001: Oh dear... Well, keep me in mind, OK?
MID_LGV_Scout_Sop_m03_002: Oh dear... Well, keep me in mind, alright? I'd be\nglad to help.
MID_LGV_Scout_Sop_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Sop_m04_001: Oh, you'd like my help? That's really nice to hear.
MID_LGV_Scout_Sop_m04_002: Oh, you'd like my help? That's really nice to hear.
MID_LGV_Scout_Sop_m04_003: But I don't know you well enough yet. So, I'm sorry\nto say no.
MID_LGV_Scout_Sop_m04_004: But I'm not sure I could do right by you. I'm sorry to\nsay you're a bit intimidating, Your Majesty!
MID_LGV_Scout_Cat_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Cat_m01_001: One moment... Let me guess why you've come.
MID_LGV_Scout_Cat_m01_002: One moment... Let me guess why you've come.
MID_LGV_Scout_Cat_m01_005: One moment... I must hear whether word has yet\nspread of your name.
MID_LGV_Scout_Cat_m01_003: Hmm...
MID_LGV_Scout_Cat_m01_004: Well, it's plain as day. You want me to join your\ngroup, don't you?
MID_LGV_Scout_Cat_m01_006: It seems that people have been spreading word of a\n"Leda." So, you've come to make me your ally?
MID_LGV_Scout_Cat_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Cat_m02_001: I knew it. Who can blame you? I'm one of the most\nsuperlative knights of this age.
MID_LGV_Scout_Cat_m02_004: I thought as much. Excuse any earlier rudeness. You\nare now a fitting match for my spear and service.
MID_LGV_Scout_Cat_m02_002: So we will fight together, starting today. I'm glad to\nserve you—though as an ally, not my lord!
MID_LGV_Scout_Cat_m02_003: So we will fight together, starting today. I'm glad to\nserve you—though as an ally, not my lord!
MID_LGV_Scout_Cat_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Cat_m03_001: Pardon? I'm sure I misheard you. I'll look forward to\nour discussing this another time.
MID_LGV_Scout_Cat_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Cat_m04_001: You clearly have an eye for the very best, having\napproached me.
MID_LGV_Scout_Cat_m04_002: You clearly have an eye for the very best, having\napproached me.
MID_LGV_Scout_Cat_m04_003: You most certainly have an eye for the very best,\nhaving approached me.
MID_LGV_Scout_Cat_m04_007: Are you really so intent on making me your ally?\nWell, you must have an eye for the very best.
MID_LGV_Scout_Cat_m04_004: As a truly sterling knight, I have a sense of when\nsomeone's right for me. And you're not—yet.
MID_LGV_Scout_Cat_m04_005: As a truly sterling knight, I have a sense of when\nsomeone's right for me. And you're not—yet.
MID_LGV_Scout_Cat_m04_006: As a sterling knight, I've a sense of when someone\nis right for me. With respect, you're not—yet.
MID_LGV_Scout_Cat_m04_008: But as a truly sterling knight, I will never grant my\nconsent until your name is more celebrated.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m01_001: What is it? Do you want to hire me?
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m01_002: Are you asking to hire me? After my own role in the\nrebellion, I'd have never thought that...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m01_003: You seem like you could be a trusted client.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m01_004: My apologies, Queen Theodora. I have no business\nquestioning your intent.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m01_005: Besides, I can sense your great strength. I'd be more\nthan happy to be hired into your service.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m01_006: You're an incomparable force in battle. I'd be more\nthan happy to be hired into your service.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m02_001: Consider the contract signed, which means that\nI work for you now.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m02_002: Then consider the contract signed, which means\nthat I work for you now.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m03_001: I see. Well, do as you please.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m03_002: I understand, Your Majesty. I am glad to be of\nservice in the future.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m04_001: You want to hire me? I could probably be some use.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m04_002: It's an honor to be approached by you...though I am\nfrom a house that backed Prince Dyan.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m04_003: But I prefer to be selective about who I work for,\nand I'm not yet sure if you're trustworthy.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m04_004: So there are more fitting people that you could hire.\nPlease, turn your search elsewhere.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m05_001: I was once a well-known Saraminian knight, but due\nto certain events, I'm now working as a mercenary.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m05_002: It's an honor to be approached by you. But you must\nrealize I am from a house that backed Prince Dyan.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m05_003: I won't follow an employer that's less than upright.\nI won't take on underhanded work.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m05_004: I was a knight who abandoned Saramis. Such a\nmercenary would bring shame to your great name.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m05_005: But you seem to be trustworthy enough, and you\ndon't look the sort to give foolish orders.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m05_006: What?! You want to employ me regardless? You are\ntoo generous, Your Majesty.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m05_007: And perhaps you have important goals and have the\ngood fortune to achieve them.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m05_008: How could I refuse you, Queen Theodora...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m05_009: So I'll gladly enter into a contract with you. How\nabout you give me this in exchange for my services?
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m05_010: Still, I'd like to enter into a contract. What would you\nthink of giving me this in exchange for my services?
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m06_001: Then we have a contract. From now on, I take\norders from you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m06_002: Then we have a contract. From now on, I gladly\ntake any and all orders from you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m06_003: The way I've trained for battle is quite different from\nhow others do. Use me however you need to.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m06_004: The way I've trained for battle is quite different from\nhow others do. Use me however you need to.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m07: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m07_001: I see. I'm a bit disappointed. Well, do as you please.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m07_002: Did you change your mind? I understand, Your\nMajesty. I am glad to be of service in the future.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m08: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m08_001: You haven't given me what I asked for. Well, I won't\noffer my skills for anything less.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ned_m08_002: That isn't what I asked for, Your Majesty. But I'm\nhappy to wait until you can deliver in full.
MID_LGV_Scout_Zac_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Zac_m01_001: Hey, you're still in the Heroic Games, aren't ya?
MID_LGV_Scout_Zac_m01_002: Ugh! I hate asking you for anything, but...
MID_LGV_Scout_Zac_m01_003: Can I join your crew? I'm not part of anyone's team.
MID_LGV_Scout_Zac_m01_004: Can I join your crew? My whole Gaia Brigade is,\nyou know...gone.
MID_LGV_Scout_Zac_m01_005: I've got nowhere to go and nothing to do. I guess\nwhat I need...is someone to take me in.
MID_LGV_Scout_Zac_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Zac_m02_001: You kind of get me, right? Good, then I can get back\nto doing my thing.
MID_LGV_Scout_Zac_m02_002: Hm? No, I don't mean that. I'm turning over a new\nleaf! Heh heh...
MID_LGV_Scout_Zac_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Zac_m03_001: Damn it! And I asked all proper-like! Would it kill\nya to be nice?
MID_LGV_Scout_Zac_m03_002: Damn it! You're really gonna keep on messing with\nme, huh? Would it kill ya to be nice?
MID_LGV_Scout_Zac_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Zac_m04_001: What? Will I join your crew?
MID_LGV_Scout_Zac_m04_002: Hey, I got beat in the games! Don't yak at me like\nwe're buddies or something.
MID_LGV_Scout_Zac_m04_003: You beat the snot out of me, and now you're gonna\njust yak at me like we're buddies?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m01_001: Can I join your crew? I'm not in anyone's team\nright now.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m01_002: Ugh. I don't wanna ask you for anything, but I'll hold\nmy nose and do it.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m01_003: I got knocked out of the Heroic Games. I failed!\nGotta say that I'm feeling kinda lost...
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m01_004: So, uh, can I join your crew? There's no one left from\nthe Gaia Brigade.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m01_005: What?! You were gonna ask me? Then spit it out\nalready! Sorry, sorry... Damn it, I'm bad at this.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m01_006: But don't think I'm gonna help for free!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m01_007: Get me? You seem like one of those real\nupstanding types...
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m01_008: So how about you fork over 10 thousand gold. Seems\nfair and square, right?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m01_009: <ICA>Fork over 10 thousand gold.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m01_010: <ICB>Refuse to pay.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m02_001: What?! A-are you serious? You're OK with that\namount?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m02_002: It's not a trick? You're for real? You know I'm not\ngonna give it back to you, right?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m02_003: <ICA>Really pay him 10 thousand gold.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m02_004: <ICB>Rethink the deal.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m03_001: Well, if you're good, I'm good! Look at you, all\ngenerous!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m04_001: What?! Don't you get it? This is about the one and\nonly Zarcone joining up with you!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m04_002: Bah, whatever. I'll let you think it over...
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m04_003: Wait! How about a thousand? That's it!\nMy FINAL offer!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m04_004: <ICA>Pay a thousand gold.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m04_005: <ICB>Refuse to pay.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m05_001: Y-you're backing out? Or you trying to strong-arm\nme? I'm not going to fiddle with my price!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m05_002: No use, huh... OK, OK, I'll bend just this once.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m05_003: So a thousand gold? My FINAL offer!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m05_004: <ICA>Pay a thousand gold.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m05_005: <ICB>Refuse to pay.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m06_001: Now we're talking! Heh. Knew you were the\ndecent sort.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m07: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m07_001: Hey, you're kind of a monster, aren't ya? Taking\nadvantage of a guy down on his luck...
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m07_002: Gonna shove me down when I'm just trying to\nstand on my own two feet. You'll regret this!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m07_003: But, uh... How about a hundred gold? Take it or\nleave it, you filthy CROOK!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m07_004: <ICA>Pay a hundred gold.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m07_005: <ICB>Refuse to pay.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m08: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m08_001: Didn't know decent types were such huge\ncheapskates. Fine, I'll let it go this time.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m09: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m09_001: Wait a second! You are the stinkiest kind of devil!\nWhat are you trying to pull?!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m09_002: I'm coming to you all honest, and I get this?\nWhat's the world coming to?!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m09_003: Fine, fine. I give up...10 gold. We'll call it good.\nCome on, I'm begging ya.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m09_004: <ICA>Pay 10 gold.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m09_005: <ICB>Refuse to pay.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m10: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m10_001: You drove a hard bargain. You're more of a scoundrel\nthan even me.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m11: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Zac_m11_001: Oh yeah?! Then the deal's off. See ya.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_OK_Zac_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_OK_Zac_m01_001: OK, we've got a deal! You got me! I'll be a part of\nyour crew. Good friends. BEST of friends!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_OK_Zac_m01_002: Now that I'm in your crew, I can go back to doing\nmy thing.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_OK_Zac_m01_003: What? No, not THAT. Or the other thing. Or ANY\nof it. Never! I'm turning over a new leaf. Heh heh...
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_NoMoney_Zac_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_NoMoney_Zac_m01_001: Wait, this isn't enough! What an insult! Hey, go\nmake some cash and then come back!
MID_LGV_Scout_Maj_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Maj_m01_001: {SetColor=Gray}When the Heroic Games first started, I was real\nfired up to get in there and win it...{SetColor=Default}
MID_LGV_Scout_Maj_m01_002: {SetColor=Gray}Then that stupid swordsman breezed in from some\nother land and stole my place in the games!{SetColor=Default}
MID_LGV_Scout_Maj_m01_003: {SetColor=Gray}Now I can't find the lady I was with...can't get any\nmoney... Everyone's treatin' me like a rat...{SetColor=Default}
MID_LGV_Scout_Maj_m01_004: It's you! Dietrich! You RUINED everything!
MID_LGV_Scout_Maj_m01_005: Huh, our paths cross again. I remember when you\nwere THIS close to being my foot licker.
MID_LGV_Scout_Maj_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Maj_m02_001: Huh? You want me to join YOUR group? Really?
MID_LGV_Scout_Maj_m02_002: I'm...I'm not cryin'! Sure, sure... I'll help you out!
MID_LGV_Scout_Maj_m02_003: Do I got a choice? Sure, fine. But don't think this\nmeans we're good.
MID_LGV_Scout_Maj_m02_004: So I guess you figured out what a big deal I am.\nGood. Took you long enough!
MID_LGV_Scout_Maj_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Maj_m03_001: Well, get lost, then. You're makin' the great Majide's\nbad mood even worse!
MID_LGV_Scout_Maj_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Maj_m04_001: You want the great Majide to be one of your little\nminions? Who do you think you are?!
MID_LGV_Scout_Maj_m04_002: I'm not in the mood for this. Majide's trust is all\nburned to nothing. Get lost.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_1st_Maj_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_1st_Maj_m01_001: {SetColor=Gray}When the Heroic Games first started, I was real\nfired up to get in there and win it...{SetColor=Default}
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_1st_Maj_m01_002: {SetColor=Gray}Then that swordsman breezed in from Fódlurn or\nwhatever it's called and stole my place in the games!{SetColor=Default}
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_1st_Maj_m01_003: It's you! Dietrich! You RUINED everything!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_1st_Maj_m01_004: Huh, our paths cross again. I remember when you\nwere THIS close to being my foot licker.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_1st_Maj_m01_005: {SetColor=Gray}Now I can't find the lady I was with...can't get any\nmoney... Everyone's treatin' me like a rat...{SetColor=Default}
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_1st_Maj_m01_006: So what's this about? You want the great Majide to\njoin your crew. Kinda weird to just ask me that.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_1st_Maj_m01_007: What do you want anyway? For the great Majide to\njoin UP with you? You gotta be kiddin' me.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_1st_Maj_m01_008: But you really want me, huh? Yeah, I get it now.\nYou NEED me. Ha! Admit it.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_1st_Maj_m01_009: <ICA>Admit it.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_1st_Maj_m01_010: <ICB>Don't.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_1st_Maj_m01_011: <ACA>Yeah, I'm not buying it though. Get lost. You think\nyou can mess with me.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_1st_Maj_m01_012: <ACA>And I'm not interested anyway! Might as well drag\nmy carcass out to the sticks.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_1st_Maj_m01_013: <ACA>Though...the idea of going somewhere that no one\nknows me ain't too hot.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_1st_Maj_m01_014: <ACB>Look, you do NOT want to mess with me. Get away\nfrom me. I can't stand to look at ya!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_2nd_Maj_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_2nd_Maj_m01_001: Pathetic... No one gets how damn great the great\nMajide is...
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_2nd_Maj_m01_002: Everyone keeps looking at me like I'm trash.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_2nd_Maj_m01_003: I don't even wanna rule this dung heap of a city now.\nThe sea can wash it all away, for all I care!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_2nd_Maj_m01_004: What do you want? Come to beg me to join your\ncrew again? You really need me THAT much?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_2nd_Maj_m01_005: <ICA>Admit it.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_2nd_Maj_m01_006: <ICB>Don't.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_2nd_Maj_m01_007: <ACA>Bah! I can't trust someone like you. You just want to\nlook all high and mighty or somethin'.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_2nd_Maj_m01_008: <ACA>Yeah, I see through it ALL now. You're tryin' to\nmake a fool of me. Well, forget it!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_2nd_Maj_m01_009: <ACB>Yeah, yeah. Get outta my sight. You've got the great\nMajide in one hell of a bad mood!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_3rd_Maj_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_3rd_Maj_m01_001: This again? You must think that ol' Majide is\ndesperate or somethin'.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_3rd_Maj_m01_002: I'm not gonna be hangin' out with anyone ever again.\nForget that! But, uh, maybe...
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_3rd_Maj_m01_003: Maybe it's time I do. It's been a while since anyone\ntold me they needed me...and meant it.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_3rd_Maj_m01_004: Maybe...you're startin' to worry about ol' Majide?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_3rd_Maj_m01_005: There's no way you'd say you need me, you know,\nfrom the bottom of your heart. Uh, is there?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_3rd_Maj_m01_006: <ICA>Say it.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_3rd_Maj_m01_007: <ICB>Don't.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_3rd_Maj_m01_008: <ACA>R-really? No foolin'? You said it to the great Majide.\nYou actually said it.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_3rd_Maj_m01_009: <ACA>Well, s'pose I don't got another choice. So, sure, fine.\nBut don't think this means we're good.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_3rd_Maj_m01_010: <ACA>I guess you figured out what a big deal I am. Good.\nTook you long enough!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_3rd_Maj_m01_011: <ACA>I'm...I'm not cryin'! Sure, sure... I'll help you out!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_3rd_Maj_m01_012: <ACA>But I'm gonna rule this city someday! And with the\nstrength of 10 MEN! Don't forget that—or else!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_3rd_Maj_m01_013: <ACB>How damn stupid can I get, thinkin' you might need\nme, even a little. I should up and disappear...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m01_001: You there! I have a proposal. Join my group!
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m01_002: I have a proposal for you. You should join my group!
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m01_003: I've decided that you have promise. You beat me,\nafter all. So you must join my group!
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m01_004: Few have any skill that's worth a fig these days, and\nI rarely recruit those that do. Take the compliment!
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m01_005: Few have any skill that's worth a fig these days, and\nI rarely recruit those that do. Enjoy the compliment!
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m01_006: You won't get this offer again—not from me! You'll\nregret it if you turn ME down!
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m01_007: I'm bringing you in on the ground floor of my\nambitious rise. So this is where you agree!
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m01_008: I'm bringing you in on the ground floor of my\nambitious rise. So I'm sure you'll agree!
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m01_009: I've got nowhere to go but up! So be glad you're\ngetting in on the ground floor here.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m02_001: I will inevitably be grabbing hold of vast amounts\nof territory. You will be making history—with ME!
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m02_002: Ooh! I'd grab myself vast amounts of territory if you\nwere in my employ!
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m02_003: I will inevitably be grabbing hold of vast amounts of\nterritory. You will be making history—with ME!
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m02_004: So from now on, you have the great honor of being\nsubordinate to my demands! Ha HA!
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m02_005: I have the highest respect of your power, and will\nplace higher demands on you than others! Ha HA!
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m02_006: I will wrap you around my little finger and exploit\nyou to the fullest. Rely on me! Ha HA!
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m03_001: Do you have a habit of walking away from your\nsuperiors? I'll wait for you to come to your senses.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m03_002: Gah! I...I suppose that's your answer for now.\nAs you please...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m03_003: Your little defeat of me has gone to your head!\nBut I am generosity itself! I can wait.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m04_001: You and I battled in the glorious arena. You surely\nsensed my sheer, terrible greatness!
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m04_002: You have grasped, it seems, what glory there is to\nbe had in serving MY command!
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m04_003: Naturally, Queen, you've realized what glory you'd\nhave, serving under my command!
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m04_004: I'm sorry to report, however, that you are not fit for\nmy employ yet. Work harder! Come back later!
MID_LGV_Scout_Ven_m04_005: But I regret to inform you that your talent can't yet\nmeet my demands. Train more. Then return.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Ven_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Ven_m01_001: Do you need something of me? How convenient.\nI've wanted to grab YOUR ear.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Ven_m01_002: Do you need something of me? How convenient.\nI've wanted to grab your ear too.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Ven_m01_003: I have a proposal that's too good to refuse. Join\nmy group!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Ven_m01_004: I won't dillydally here. I'll get right to the point.\nJoin my group!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Ven_m01_005: I've decided that you have promise. You beat me,\nafter all. So you must join my group!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Ven_m01_006: Few have any skill that's worth a fig these days.\nTake the compliment!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Ven_m01_007: I can't think of the last time I extended such an offer\nto someone. But you, Your Majesty, deserve it.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Ven_m01_008: I'm bringing you in on the ground floor of my\nambitious rise. So this is where you agree!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Ven_m01_009: Your strength got you in the door, you see! You can\nbe there for my ambitious rise.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Ven_m01_010: I've already been making preparations. Come now!\nJoin my army!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Ven_m01_011: I've already made all the preparations. So tell me!\nWill you join me?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Ven_m01_012: <ICA>Agree to become allies.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Ven_m01_013: <ICB>Decline.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_001: Ha HA! The right answer! It's only natural that you'd\nwant this.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_002: Ha HA! Of course! It's only natural!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_003: A chance to join my group doesn't come along every\nday. I'm sure you know that.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_004: A chance to join my group doesn't come along every\nday. I know you know that.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_005: Doesn't this feel good? Yes! And you'll feel even\nbetter after I tell you a story—about me!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_006: Doesn't this feel good, Your Majesty? And you know\nwhat would feel better? A story about me!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_007: This story harks back to my early days, when I was\na decurion—given command of 10 soldiers.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_008: This story harks back to my early days, when I was\na decurion—given command of 10 soldiers.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_009: One night, I had a dream! A dream about a great\ngeneral, commanding a legion of thousands!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_010: One night, I had a dream. It was a dream of a great\ngeneral, commanding a legion of thousands to attack.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_011: It was ME! Oh, my voice was glorious, driving my\nlegion toward the enemy army!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_012: It was ME! Oh, my voice was glorious, driving my\nlegion toward the enemy army!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_013: Then my dream unfurled its wings! My legion laid\nwaste to army after army! My voice had NO equal!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_014: Then my dream unfurled its wings! My legion laid\nwaste to army after army! My voice had NO equal!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_015: It was—obviously—a divine revelation. I awoke all of\na sudden, as if struck by a bolt of lightning.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_016: It was—obviously—a divine revelation. I awoke all of\na sudden, as if struck by a bolt of lightning.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_017: I grasped instantly what it all meant. I was meant to\nbe that general. I would put my all into this effort.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_018: I grasped instantly what it all meant. I was meant to\nbe that general. I would put my all into this effort.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_019: I studied tactics like a madman, memorizing the full\nworks of the Great August.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_020: I studied tactics like a madman, memorizing the full\nworks of the Great August.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_021: I seized upon knowledge. I made myself more\ncultured. I trained my body, ready to BE that general!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_022: I seized upon knowledge. I made myself more\ncultured. I trained my body, ready to BE that general!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_023: ...and then I was fired. Dismissed in disgrace.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_024: ...and then I was fired. Dismissed in disgrace.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_025: ...
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_026: Ahem... What were we talking about?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_027: Ahem... What were we talking about?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_028: Ah, yes! I'm letting you join my group!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_029: Ah, yes! I'm letting you join my group!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_030: My great name will be written boldly across the\npages of history! I'll ensure your name is included.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_031: With your help, I will become that general and get\nmy great name written across the pages of history!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_032: So from now on, you have the honor of being\nsubordinate to my demands! Ha HA!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeA_Ven_m01_033: I have the highest respect for your power, and will\nplace higher demands on you than others! Ha HA!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m01_001: What? Didn't you hear me? Come now! Join\nmy army!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m01_002: Oh, sorry? You didn't hear my words, I take it.\nNow! Will you join me?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m01_003: <ICA>Agree to become allies.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m01_004: <ICB>Decline.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m02_001: Speak up! I can't hear you. Just say, "I will join\nyour army!" Or something, anything!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m02_002: Sorry. I didn't make that out. Did you just say you'd\nbecome my ally?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m02_003: <ICA>Agree to become allies.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m02_004: <ICB>Decline.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m03_001: Speak up if you wish to be heard! Now, quickly!\nSay you'll join my army!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m03_002: I very much apologize. My hearing is crummy these\ndays. You're...agreeing to join my army, yes?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m03_003: <ICA>Agree to become allies.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m03_004: <ICB>Decline.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m04_001: I swear I heard you decline. But that can't be.\nHa HA, no! You want to join my group, of course!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m04_002: Y-you said no? Ah, sorry. The words "decline" and\n"join" sound so similar. You said YES, yes?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m04_003: <ICA>Agree to become allies.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m04_004: <ICB>Decline.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m05_001: Oh! Standing in the presence of me has shocked\nopposite talk into you. Be calm. Now, answer!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m05_002: Oh, I understand. You are worried about your duty to\nSaramis. Worry not at all. I will help with that.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m05_003: <ICA>Agree to become allies.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m05_004: <ICB>Decline.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m06_001: I see. Are you worried I can't pay you? The honor\nof serving me will make up for that!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m06_002: Your Majesty, are you worried that I can't pay you?\nThe honor of serving me will make up for that!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m06_003: <ICA>Agree to become allies.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m06_004: <ICB>Decline.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m07: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m07_001: Hmm. So honor alone isn't enough. Well, you drive\na hard bargain. I'll throw in this deluxe eye patch.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m07_002: The nerve! Such honor is worth more than gold!\nWell, how about I throw in this deluxe eye patch?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m07_003: <ICA>Agree to become allies.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m07_004: <ICB>Decline.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m08: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m08_001: You don't like the eye patch? How greedy you are.\nThen, here! Take my extra-deluxe nose ring too!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m08_002: You don't need an eye patch? Well, your eyes are\nquite fine. Then I'll add this extra-deluxe nose ring.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m08_003: <ICA>Agree to become allies.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m08_004: <ICB>Decline.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m09: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m09_001: You don't need that either? You have a keen sense\nof your worth. That makes me value you more!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m09_002: Eh? You will...have my head? Oh! A jest, a joke!\nI love humor. That makes me value you more!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m09_003: <ICA>Agree to become allies.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m09_004: <ICB>Decline.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m10: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m10_001: I see... Well, the writings of the Great August extol\nthe tactical virtue of knowing when to quit.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m10_002: I see... Well, the writings of the Great August extol\nthe tactical virtue of knowing when to quit.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m10_003: So I will withdraw for today. I won't give up on you\nthough. Remember that!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reaction_TypeB_Ven_m10_004: So I will withdraw for today. But I won't give up on\nyou, Your Majesty. Remember that!
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m01_001: Um, I wonder... Would you let me join you?
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m01_002: Um, I wonder... Would you let me join you?
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m01_003: Um, I wonder... Do you remember me? We fought\nin the Heroic Games.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m01_004: I rely on my archery skills to get by. I could make\nthem better, working with you... Please...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m01_005: I rely on my archery skills to get by. I could make\nthem better, working with you... Please...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m01_006: You beat me in...that state I was in. I need to make\nmy archery skills better. Could I join you? Please...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m02_001: Thank you... I'm glad I worked up the nerve to talk\nto you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m02_002: Thank you... I'm glad I worked up the nerve to\nactually speak to you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m02_003: Oh, good... I was really worried that you'd reject me,\ngiven how I was during that match...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m02_004: I'll work hard—I promise. You won't regret this...\nI'm looking forward...to being a part of your group.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m02_005: I'll work hard for you—I promise. You won't regret\nthis... I feel fortunate...to serve your needs.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m02_006: I'll work hard—I promise. You won't regret this...\nI'm looking forward...to proving myself to you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m03_001: Of course... It makes sense to say no. But please let\nme know...if you change your mind.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m03_002: Of course... It makes perfect sense to say no. But\nplease let me know...if you change your mind.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m03_003: I understand... I can't do...what I could before.\nLet me know...if you ever change your mind.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m04_001: What? You want...me to join your group? Are you\nbeing...serious?
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m04_002: What? You want...me to join your group? I'm sorry\nto ask, but...are you being serious?
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m04_003: I wonder...have I met you somewhere... Sorry\nthough, this is a bad time for me...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m04_004: I'm sorry...but I don't know much about you.\nBesides, this is a bad time for me...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m04_005: I'm very sorry, but...this is a bad time for me...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m05_001: You want to hire me? I do need work...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m05_002: You want to employ me? I really do need work...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m05_003: I wonder...have I met you somewhere? Oh...you're\namong those I fought in the Heroic Games...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m05_004: I had money...but I gave it all...to the Order of\nMithras.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m05_005: I had money...but I gave it all away...to the Order\nof Mithras.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m05_006: I don't remember much...from the time I was in\npossession of Ugo's Bow...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m05_007: In return, they gave me Ugo's Bow...which is how\nI came to be called Magic-Bow Inyoni.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m05_008: In return, they gave me Ugo's Bow...which is how\nI came to be called Magic-Bow Inyoni.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m05_009: I'm sorry for any...and all...trouble I caused you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m05_010: I've cut ties with the Order of Mithras... I don't have\nmore bows... I've got no money...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m05_011: I've severed ties with the Order of Mithras... I don't\nhave any more bows... I'm out of money...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m05_012: I've cut ties with the Order of Mithras... So I'm\ndesperate for work...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m05_013: My skill remains strong, however... If you give me\nmoney so I can buy bows, I'll join your team...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m05_014: My skill remains strong, however... If you give me\nmoney so I can buy bows, I'll gladly join your team...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m06_001: I can have this? Thank you... I'm so glad to be part of\nyour team...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m06_002: I can have this? Thank you... I feel so fortunate to be\npart of your team...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m06_003: I'll do my very best for you... I really don't want you\nregretting it... I look forward to this...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m06_004: I'll do my best for you... I really don't want you\nregretting it... I look forward to this...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m07: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m07_001: Of course... I see why you'd turn me down. But if\nyou change your mind, please let me know...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m07_002: Yes, of course... I see why you'd turn me down. But if\nyou change your mind, please let me know...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m08: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m08_001: That's not what I need... I can't fight without the\nright equipment. I'm here when you're ready...
MID_LGV_Scout_Ini_m08_002: Sorry, that's not what I need... I can't fight without\nthe right equipment. I'm here when you're ready...
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m01_001: I've heard about you. You've got a reputation for\nbeing pretty darn strong. That about right?
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m01_002: I've been hearing more about you lately. It's no\nsurprise that you defeated my clan in the games.
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m01_003: I've heard a lot about you, Queen Theodora. Such\na great woman, famed for martial excellence.
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m01_004: Would you let me join your group? That'd really help\nmy own reputation grow.
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m01_005: Would you grant this mercenary the great honor of\nshowing off her own strength at your side?
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m02_001: Then it's settled. We're good as family now.
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m02_002: Then it's settled. We're good as family now.
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m02_003: Eating, drinking, laughing...even dying in battle...\nwe're going to do it all together!
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m02_004: Eating, drinking, laughing...even dying in battle...\nwe're going to do it all together!
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m03_001: That was cold, don't you think? I don't see any\ndownsides to bringing me on.
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m03_002: I see... I'll be waiting if you ever want to talk more\nabout this.
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m04_001: I was once part of a mercenary crew... I thought of\n'em all as family.
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m04_002: I was once part of a mercenary crew... I thought of\n'em all as family.
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m04_003: You and I aren't at all that close yet. Sorry, but let's\ntalk again some other time.
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m04_004: I'd be happy to feel like family, Your Majesty, but\nthat wouldn't be proper. I can't join you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m05_001: Are you in the market for a skilled mercenary?\nWhat a coincidence, me too!
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m05_002: Your Majesty, are you searching for a skilled\nmercenary? What a coincidence, me too!
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m05_003: I have a big dream to pull together my own band\nof mercenaries. So I'm building relationships.
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m05_004: I have a big dream to pull together my own band\nof mercenaries. So I'm building relationships.
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m05_005: But you know how it is, right? To hire people like\nthat, you need a lot of fame and money.
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m05_006: But you must know how it goes. To hire people like\nthat, you need a lot of fame and money.
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m05_007: If I battled on your crew, I'd earn pay and keep\nmaking my own name known.
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m05_008: If I could show off my skills by Your Majesty's side,\nI'd be well on my way.
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m05_009: So, long story short, how about you hire me?\nI'm a hard worker.
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m05_010: I'll work really hard for you, Your Majesty. Please,\nconsider me a steadfast soldier.
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m06_001: Good! Then it's settled! We're as good as family\nfrom now on.
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m06_002: Then it's settled! We're as good as family from\nnow on.
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m06_003: Drinking, laughing, celebrating victories, even\ncrying over losses... We'll do it all together!
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m06_004: Whether celebrating our victories or crying over\nlosses... We'll do it all together!
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m07: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m07_001: Oh? That's cold. I thought we could be kind of\nlike family.
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m07_002: I see... That's a shame. I'll be waiting if you'd ever\nlike to get in touch.
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m08: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m08_001: Haha! You don't have it, do you? No worries. Just\nbring it next time.
MID_LGV_Scout_Jas_m08_002: I'm sorry to say this, but you don't have it. Please\nlet me know when you do.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ale_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Ale_m01_001: So I have a favor to ask, though I know it's a big\nrequest. Could I fight alongside you?
MID_LGV_Scout_Ale_m01_002: After my defeat in the Heroic Games, I realized\nthe true extent of my inexperience.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ale_m01_003: That's why I want to polish my skills in service of\nsomeone who is strong—and keeps winning!
MID_LGV_Scout_Ale_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Ale_m02_001: Oh! Thank you very much. I will give it my all!
MID_LGV_Scout_Ale_m02_002: Ah, and my partner, Bucephalus, will be serving\nwith me. Please treat my dear pegasus well!
MID_LGV_Scout_Ale_m02_003: Ah, and Bucephalus will join me as well. He's nearly\nbeen prancing at the prospect of this!
MID_LGV_Scout_Ale_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Ale_m03_001: I see. That makes sense. I apologize for taking\nyour time. Please keep fighting the good fight!
MID_LGV_Scout_Ale_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Ale_m04_001: I appreciate the offer. But I feel that my skills are\nstill lacking.
MID_LGV_Scout_Ale_m04_002: There are many others who have far more talent,\nso I'd suggest that you ask them.
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m01_001: Hey, c'mon! Let me into your crew. I've got the law\non my tail. I'll hang if they catch up.
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m01_002: Hey, c'mon! You gotta let me into your crew. The\nlaw's on my tail. I'll hang if they catch me!
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m01_003: I ain't picky about work, and I don't cause no trouble.\nDo a good deed! Get me outta here!
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m01_004: It's your fault I've come to this! I ain't kidding! You\ngotta do right by me now. Get me outta here!
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m02_001: I won't forget this. I've got more time this side of\nthe boneyard, thanks to you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m02_002: Course you will, you briny rump of a sea beast!\nI ain't goin' easy, not without a fight!
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m02_003: You can count on Kiroc the Rukh! I'll be countin' on\nyou too. Been lookin' for a safe place to roost!
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m02_004: No, not today, not ever. I'll follow your orders, long\nas I can count on you. Need a safe place to roost!
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m03_001: Why in the infernal fathoms not?! I ain't gonna\ntake no for an answer!
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m03_002: Why in the watery hells not, you salty scoundrel?\nIt's YOU who should be worm dirt by now!
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m04_001: I've lost all I got, and you're throwin' me a lifeline...\nFriend! Dearest friend!
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m04_002: Talimun?! You ruined me AND my ship! You're\nworse than a pirate, you filthy sea scum!
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m04_003: Wait! Is this about the bounty on me? You're goin'\nto turn me in to the temples! Well, NO you ain't!
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m04_004: I'd rather dance with every waterlogged ghost in a\nthousand leagues than see YOU. Get outta here!
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m05_001: You know all about me, eh? Kiroc the Rukh! Captain\nof the Black-Swan Pirates, terror of the Danann Sea!
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m05_002: You dripping barnacle! Bet you can't forget ME,\nKiroc the Rukh—captain of the Black-Swan Pirates!
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m05_003: Or I should say was their captain. Until I got done in\nby THAT guy... Now I'm just a nobody crook here.
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m05_004: Or I should say...was their captain. You got me good\nand thorough. I'm just a nobody crook here.
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m05_005: That ain't the half of it either. I almost died, and\never since, I see terrifying ghosts, even by day...
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m05_006: B-but just checkin'. You aren't a ghost, are you?\nThey show up when I least expect it...
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m05_007: You ruined me! If you have even the smallest\nsliver of a soul, bring me into your crew!
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m05_008: You don't have any ghost-killin' stuff, do ya?\nGimme all you got, then I'll join up!
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m05_009: Just one thing though... Do you have any ghost-killin'\nstuff? Gimme all you got. Then I'll join you!
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m06_001: I'll remember this! Maybe I just need 'em to ease\nmy mind, but they keep me even. Thank you!
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m06_002: So you've got some! Maybe I just need 'em to ease\nmy mind, but they keep me even.
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m06_003: A pirate oath is sacred. I pledge myself to you. I'm\ncountin' on you—also for a safe place to roost!
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m06_004: Now that I'm in your crew, I'll follow your orders. I'm\ncountin' on you—also for a safe place to roost!
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m07: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m07_001: What in the inky depths? You're makin' me look\nlike a fool. If I go to worm food, I'll haunt you!
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m08: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Kir_m08_001: C'mon now! You either have enough or you don't!\nDon't kid around. This is life and death for me!
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m01_001: You say you want me to be your ally. That is perfect.
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m01_002: Descendant of Yu Phas. Your life is sacred to the\nHar Hali.
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m01_003: Queen of Saramis, I cannot thank you enough for\naccepting us.
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m01_004: Now that I have finished my service as acting chief,\nI was seeking a place to fight as a Har Hali warrior.
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m01_005: My strength is yours, if you will have it. Would you\nallow me to fight at your side?
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m01_006: I would be a boon to you, and I in turn would be\nstrengthened through combat.
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m01_007: As a Har Hali warrior, I promise that my victories\nwill be yours as well.
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m02_001: Call on me when it is time for battle. Even a small\nsignal will suffice.
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m02_002: I am grateful. Call on me when it is time for battle.
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m02_003: I will hasten to join you wherever you are, that I\nmight take the heads of your enemies.
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m03_001: Hrm... So you have changed your mind. Far be it\nfrom me to gainsay your decision.
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m03_002: I see...perhaps I was too forward. If you change your\nmind, I would eagerly accept.
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m04_001: You want my might? A word of advice, then.
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m04_002: Do not recruit a man whose story you do not know.\nIt is a fast way to die in your sleep.
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m05_001: You want me to join you? I would welcome that.
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m05_002: I have been serving as the acting chief of the\nHar Hali, but that role has ended.
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m05_003: If I learn the ways of the outside world as a simple\nwarrior under you, my people stand to benefit.
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m05_004: So I am not unwilling. The question is, will you make\nit worth my effort?
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m06_001: Call on me when it is time for battle. Even a small\nsignal will suffice.
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m06_002: I will hasten to join you wherever you are, that I\nmight take the heads of your enemies.
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m07: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m07_001: Hrm... So you have changed your mind. Far be it\nfrom me to gainsay your decision.
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m08: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Nuz_m08_001: If you do not have what I ask, say so. Deceit will not\ngo unpunished.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Tia_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Tia_m01_001: Thank you so much for helping Cai out!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Tia_m01_002: I truly appreciate the way you helped Cai recently.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Tia_m01_003: It's been quite a while since Cai appeared so happy.\nIt's nice to see again.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Tia_m01_004: It's been a long time since I saw Cai so happy.\nIt's nice to see again.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Tia_m01_005: Huh? Help you fight?!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Tia_m01_006: Huh? Help you fight?!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Tia_m01_007: I know you're someone I can trust, and I'd be happy\nto help you...
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Tia_m01_008: I know you're someone I can trust, and I'd be happy\nto help you...
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Tia_m01_009: But in return... OK, well, not in return, because that\nsounds rude, but could you do something for me?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Tia_m01_010: But, um, may I ask a favor of you first?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Tia_m01_011: I hate to ask this, but I really need some money.\nCould you lend me three thousand gold?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Tia_m01_012: I hate to ask this, but I really need some money.\nCould you lend me three thousand gold?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Tia_m01_013: <ICA>Ask the reason.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Tia_m01_014: <ICB>Decline.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01_001: I'm trying to acquire a copy of the manuscript of\n"Ice Falls on Aegina," a famous play.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01_002: I'm trying to acquire a copy of the manuscript of\n"Ice Falls on Aegina," a famous play.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01_003: It was written by Dante when she was just starting\nout, and its first performance was only a year later.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01_004: It was written by Dante when she was just starting\nout, and its first performance was only a year later.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01_005: It was quite popular, and the manuscript was copied\nhundreds of times. Recently, I found a special copy...
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01_006: It was quite popular, and the manuscript was copied\nhundreds of times. Recently, I found a special copy...
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01_007: A reproduction made by the famous manuscript\nartisan Beatrice!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01_008: A reproduction made by the famous manuscript\nartisan Beatrice!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01_009: The story goes that she worked from an original\ncopy handwritten by Dante herself!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01_010: The story goes that she worked from an original\ncopy handwritten by Dante herself!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01_011: Furthermore, Beatrice didn't just copy Dante's words,\nshe perfectly duplicated her handwriting!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01_012: Furthermore, Beatrice didn't just copy Dante's words,\nshe perfectly duplicated her handwriting!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01_013: They say Beatrice's manuscript so perfectly matched\nDante's handwriting that they're indistinguishable!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01_014: They say Beatrice's manuscript so perfectly matched\nDante's handwriting that they're indistinguishable!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01_015: Normally, the price of one of these copies would be\noutlandishly high...
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01_016: Normally, the price of one of these copies would be\noutlandishly high...
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01_017: But I found a copy being sold for three thousand\ngold! It's an incredible bargain!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01_018: But I found a copy being sold for three thousand\ngold! It's an incredible bargain!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01_019: Heh...sorry. I get a little excited just thinking about it.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01_020: Heh...sorry. I get a little excited just thinking about it.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01_021: So there you are. That's why I need the gold.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01_022: So there you are. That's why I need the gold.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01_023: <ICA>Give her the three thousand gold.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m01_024: <ICB>Decline.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m02_001: Oh?! Thank you! Thank you so much!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m02_002: Oh?! Thank you! Thank you so much!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m02_003: I will work so hard to repay this favor. I promise!\nI look forward to working with you!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Reason_Tia_m02_004: I will work so hard to repay this favor. I promise!\nI look forward to working with you!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_No_Tia_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_No_Tia_m01_001: No, you're right. I shouldn't have brought up money\nlike that. It's nothing, forget it...
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_No_Tia_m01_002: No, you're right. I shouldn't have brought up money\nlike that. It's nothing, forget it...
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_No_Tia_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_No_Tia_m02_001: I see... Sorry for pestering you. I'll manage it\nmyself, somehow.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_No_Tia_m02_002: I see... Sorry for pestering you. I'll manage it\nmyself, somehow.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_NoMoney_Tia_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_NoMoney_Tia_m01_001: Um... This isn't quite enough. I'm sorry for bothering\nyou. I'll ask someone else.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_NoMoney_Tia_m01_002: Um... This isn't quite enough. I'm sorry for bothering\nyou. I'll ask someone else.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Fab_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Fab_m01_001: Ah. Have you by some chance come to recruit me?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Fab_m01_002: Hm. If you are capable of correctly assessing my\nabilities, I have no argument.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Fab_m01_003: Very well. I am unoccupied at the moment, and I am\nin debt for your aid.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Fab_m01_004: Moreover, I have taken a personal interest in you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Fab_m01_005: I have one condition and one condition only.\nI require something of equal worth.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Fab_m01_006: What? I have no wish to be treated as a disposable\ntrinket, freely taken.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Fab_m01_007: What is important is how you value me.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Fab_m01_008: I make no demands, however. Indeed, I leave it to\nyou to choose what you consider suitable.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Fab_m01_009: <ICA>Give him something.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Fab_m01_010: <ICB>Refuse.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_ItemChoice_Fab_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_ItemChoice_Fab_m01_001: <DLG>Select something to give to Fabio.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_NoGive_Fab_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_NoGive_Fab_m01_001: Is that it? You quit now? Dear me. You think nothing\nof wasting my time, do you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Fab_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Fab_m01_001: Ah! An estimable item. It seems you value me more\nthan I had thought.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Fab_m01_002: Did you hope to catch my unguarded reaction upon\ndelivery? As you can see, that didn't work.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Fab_m01_003: The more expensive the gift, the happier I would be,\nyou thought? Quite a miscalculation on your part.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Fab_m01_004: No, I cannot see myself working with you. Let us\npretend we never spoke.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Fab_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Fab_m02_001: My word. This is an exquisite item. Is it for me?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Fab_m02_002: I see. Your feelings have resonated within me.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Fab_m02_003: Let me return this. I can see that it means much\nto you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Fab_m02_004: From now on, you will have my assistance.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Fab_m02_005: Never take for granted how fortunate you are to have\nsecured the aid of so puissant a companion.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Fab_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Fab_m03_001: Hm. What exactly is this?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Fab_m03_002: I can see how little you value me.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Fab_m03_003: Offering this to me is preposterous. Please expend a\nlittle effort next time.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Fab_m03_004: It is I, not you, who was at fault. After all, only a fool\nexpects anything of a fool.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Fab_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Fab_m05_001: It seems you have nothing to offer, and so there is\nnothing to discuss. I await your return.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m01_001: Oho. I take it you hope to gain my assistance?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m01_002: I may consider it but only if the request is serious.\nLet that be clear.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m01_003: <ICA>Agree.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m01_004: <ICB>Decline.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m02_001: I am oft known by the title Mastermind of Saramis.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m02_002: If you seek the benefit of my counsel, I trust you\nknow how to use me to my full potential.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m02_003: Can you truthfully say that? Consider your response\nwith care.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m02_004: <ICA>Agree.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m02_005: <ICB>Decline.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m03_001: I have long served Queen Theodora as Her Majesty's\nright arm.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m03_002: I have served Saramis loyally since the last king.\nYou must understand the import of leaving my post.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m03_003: Yet here you are. And so I ask of you again: knowing\nall of this, you would still request my aid?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m03_004: <ICA>Agree.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m03_005: <ICB>Decline.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m04_001: Very well, then! In that case, consider me your ally.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m04_002: Saramis is facing grave difficulties now. And yet...
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m04_003: I see that as all the more reason for someone to stay\nhere in the capital to be our queen's eyes and ears.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m04_004: In fact, I have recently spoken with Her Majesty on\nthis very subject.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m04_005: But even if I had not, I could hardly turn down a\nrequest—thrice over!—from such a stalwart warrior.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m04_006: Your ardor and resolve in seeking me is much\nappreciated.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m04_007: Though I cannot help but fret over Her Majesty,\nshe is in safe enough hands with Tobias.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Bon_m04_008: My wisdom is yours for the foreseeable future.\nI look forward to working with you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_No_Bon_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_No_Bon_m01_001: Ohoho! This faltering resolve will not do. Ask again\nwhen your stance is firmer.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Tob_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Tob_m01_001: So what's going on? Something I can do for you?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Tob_m01_002: I don't mind hearing you out, but I'm awful thirsty...
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Tob_m01_003: My throat's dry as a desert. I can't live like this!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Tob_m01_004: You wouldn't happen to be able to spare a guy\na drink, huh? I'll hear you out after, promise!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Tob_m01_005: <ICA>Give him something.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Start_Tob_m01_006: <ICB>Refuse.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_ItemChoice_Tob_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_ItemChoice_Tob_m01_001: <DLG>Select a gift for Tobias.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_NoGive_Tob_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_NoGive_Tob_m01_001: So you're just gonna ignore a desperate man?!\nTalk about heartless!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Tob_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Tob_m01_001: *gulp* *gulp* Ahhh! I'm saved!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Tob_m01_002: Whew! That was good stuff. I downed the whole\nthing in one go!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Tob_m01_003: Just what I needed! Alright, let's get back to what it\nwas you needed.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Tob_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Tob_m02_001: Mm, that's tasty! I needed that.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Tob_m02_002: It's not my beverage of choice, but I won't say no\nwhen I'm thirsty.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Tob_m02_003: Thanks, pal! So, you needed me for something?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Tob_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Tob_m03_001: Not really what I had in mind, but beggars can't be\nchoosers, I guess. Bottoms up...
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Tob_m03_002: Urch! What is this?! Gross! I'm even thirstier now\nthan I was before!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Tob_m03_003: Also, my stomach doesn't feel so good. Uh, let's pick\nthis up some other time.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Tob_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_GiveReaction_Tob_m05_001: Really? You don't have anything? Some help you\nare in a crisis!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_OK_Tob_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_OK_Tob_m01_001: Ahh, I getcha. You want me to join up with you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_OK_Tob_m01_002: Well, hell, who wouldn't want the Lionheart of\nSaramis on their team?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_OK_Tob_m01_003: You did help me out, so I kinda owe you anyway.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_OK_Tob_m01_004: No time like the present to return the favor. Yeah,\nsure, I'm in!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_OK_Tob_m01_005: Gotta say, I've been kinda curious about you. And it'll\ngive me some great stories to tell the boss!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_OK_Tob_m01_006: What's that? Am I worried about her? Gwahaha!\nWhat for?!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_OK_Tob_m01_007: She's got Bona with her, and if I know Bona, he's\ngonna watch her like a hawk.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_OK_Tob_m01_008: Alright! This oughta be fun. Hope you'll put me\nsomewhere I can do some damage!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m01_001: What's that? You require my aid?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m01_002: Pardon? You say you require my strength?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m01_003: I am grateful to you for your assistance to milady.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m01_004: I am indebted to you for your assistance to milady.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m01_005: Although...frustrated with myself for being of so little\nuse at that critical time.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m01_006: Albeit...frustrated with myself for being of so little\nuse at that critical time.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m01_007: It made me question why I have stayed at milady's\nside all this time.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m01_008: It made me question for what purpose I have stayed\nat milady's side all this time.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m01_009: She saw that I was tormenting myself for that failure.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m01_010: She saw that I was tormenting myself for that failure.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m01_011: And said she would not mind dismissing me, if the\nchange of environment might ease my distress.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m01_012: And said she would not mind dismissing me, if the\nchange of environment might ease my distress.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m01_013: Of course, I understand that this is milady's way of\nshowing her care for me.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m01_014: Of course, I know well that this is milady's way of\nshowing her care for me.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m01_015: And she may be right that some distance might be\nbest for both of our sakes.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m01_016: And she may be right that some distance might be\nbest for both of our sakes.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m01_017: So if you're saying you need my strength, I have no\nreason to say no.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m01_018: Which is to say, if you need my strength, I have no\nreason to say no.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m01_019: <ICA>Agree.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m01_020: <ICB>Decline.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m02_001: Thank you! I will take our time together as a chance\nto reflect on loyalty.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m02_002: You have my gratitude! I will take our time together\nas a chance to reflect on loyalty.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m02_003: Please, put the Demon Bear of Baphos to use!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m02_004: Please, use the Demon Bear of Baphos as you see fit!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m03_001: Oh... I see. Do tell me if you change your mind.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Buc_m03_002: Oh... I understand. Do tell me if you change\nyour mind.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m01_001: I knew I could feel someone staring at me.\nYou wanted to speak?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m01_002: I knew I could feel someone staring at me. Did you\nwant to speak to me?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m01_003: By the way, I was impressed by your fluid movement\nin that match against the king of Brigid.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m01_004: I must say, I was impressed by your performance in\nthat match against the king of Brigid.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m01_005: Your combat skills are marvelous to behold—\nI enjoyed watching you from the audience.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m01_006: Your combat skills are marvelous to behold—\nI enjoyed watching Your Majesty from the audience.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m01_007: As one would expect from a warrior whom he\nso respects...
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m01_008: As one would expect from a warrior whom he\nso respects...
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m01_009: Oh, pay me no mind. I was thinking aloud.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m01_010: Apologies. Please pay me no mind. I was\nthinking aloud.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m01_011: After that match, I have to say I've taken an interest\nin you. I'd like to observe you up close.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m01_012: After that match, I have to say I've taken an interest\nin Your Majesty. I would like to observe you up close.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m01_013: If you were to request my assistance, I'd be all too\nglad to oblige.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m01_014: If you were to request my assistance, I would be\nwilling—and delighted—to oblige.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m01_015: <ICA>Agree.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m01_016: <ICB>Decline.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m02_001: Then here's to a fruitful partnership. I look forward\nto fighting alongside you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m02_002: Then here's to a fruitful partnership. I look forward\nto fighting alongside Your Majesty.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m02_003: Now, I must admit, I am rather busy.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m02_004: Now, I must admit, I am laden with some personal\nresponsibilities.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m02_005: I can't guarantee I won't be called away to handle an\nurgent matter.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m02_006: I cannot guarantee I won't be called away to handle\nan urgent matter.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m02_007: But no need to worry about that now. For the time\nbeing, I don't anticipate any problems.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m02_008: Hopefully you can forgive me if that happens.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m03_001: Not interested? That's fine—if somewhat\ndisappointing.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Gat_m03_002: Ah, so Your Majesty has reconsidered. That's a pity.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Urs_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Urs_m01_001: I see... So you'd like to contract me as an ally, is\nthat right?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Urs_m01_002: Well, with the games behind us and the company\nthriving, perhaps something can be arranged.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Urs_m01_003: Either way, joining your side is quite the compelling\noffer to be sure.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Urs_m01_004: However, before I sign anything, there are just a few\nnonnegotiables we should establish...
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Urs_m01_005: First, you should know that my responsibilities at\nVandahl Trading will always take precedence.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Urs_m01_006: In the case of an emergency at the company, I may\nhave to withdraw from your side. Is that alright?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Urs_m01_007: <ICA>Agree.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Urs_m01_008: <ICB>Decline.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Urs_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Urs_m02_001: And if I leave, neither I nor Vandahl Trading can be\nresponsible for misfortunes accrued in my absence.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Urs_m02_002: <ICA>Agree.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Urs_m02_003: <ICB>Decline.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Urs_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Urs_m03_001: Lastly, as a show of compromise, you will not be\nrequired to show our company any special treatment.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Urs_m03_002: However, I will be reporting to Talimun about you\nand my activities by your side. Is that alright?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Urs_m03_003: <ICA>Agree.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Urs_m03_004: <ICB>Decline.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Urs_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Urs_m04_001: This is perfect. I was just telling Talimun we needed\nto keep an eye on this one.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Urs_m04_002: What a happy coincidence. And the timing couldn't\nbe better...
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Urs_m04_003: Oh! Excuse me. I was just thinking out loud.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Urs_m04_004: Anyway, this all sounds good to me. I'll have the\ncompany send you the proper documents later.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Urs_m04_005: For now, consider our contract complete and me\nyour new ally. I look forward to working with you!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_No_Urs_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_No_Urs_m05_001: Shame... Then this conversation never happened.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Die_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Die_m01_001: Heh, so you want me to join you?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Die_m01_002: Might not be a bad idea, actually.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Die_m01_003: There was a time, even recently, that I couldn't\nimagine leaving Orchel's side.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Die_m01_004: But lately, I've started to realize that my skills are far\nmore lacking than I guessed.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Die_m01_005: Everyone around me is greater than human. I need\nto adapt somehow...or I'll get left behind.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Die_m01_006: That's the last thing I want. So I have to get\na lot stronger.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Die_m01_007: I know exactly how strong you are, given your\nmatches in the games, among other recent events.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Die_m01_008: I'm well aware of your strength, given your matches\nin the games, among other recent events.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Die_m01_009: If I go with you, I might be able to become much\nstronger myself—in new ways.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Die_m01_010: If I go with you, I might be able to become much\nstronger myself—in new ways.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Die_m01_011: But know if I travel with you, my devotion will\nalways belong to Orchel.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Die_m01_012: But know if I travel with you, my devotion will\nalways belong to Orchel.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Die_m01_013: As long as you're alright with that, I have no\nproblem joining up with you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Die_m01_014: <ICA>Agree.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Die_m01_015: <ICB>Decline.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Die_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Die_m02_001: I'll stay close to you and work on this. I've got to\nmake myself into a far stronger person.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Die_m02_002: I'll stay close to you and work on this. I've got to\nforge myself into a far stronger person.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Die_m02_003: I choose to believe that, in the end, it will help me\nprotect Orchel better.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Die_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Die_m03_001: What, you're backing out? Fine by me.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Scouting_Sar_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Scouting_Sar_m01_001: You'd like me to fight alongside you?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Scouting_Sar_m01_002: You'd like me to fight alongside you?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Scouting_Sar_m01_003: Everyone escaped the village somehow, thanks to you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Scouting_Sar_m01_004: Everyone escaped the village somehow, thanks to you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Scouting_Sar_m01_005: I was able to act as Anatolia's Guardian.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Scouting_Sar_m01_006: I was able to act as Anatolia's Guardian.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Scouting_Sar_m01_007: As a thank-you, I will accept your offer. But I do\nhave a condition.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Scouting_Sar_m01_008: As a thank-you, I will accept your offer. But I do\nhave a condition.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Scouting_Sar_m01_009: If you want me to join you, I need to know if you\ncan answer a question first.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Scouting_Sar_m01_010: If you want me to join you, I need to know if you\ncan answer a question first.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Scouting_Sar_m01_011: I want to learn more about the world. 
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Scouting_Sar_m01_012: I want to learn more about the world. 
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Scouting_Sar_m01_013: Before I join you, I'd like to see how much you know.\nDoes that sound good to you?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Scouting_Sar_m01_014: Before I join you, I'd like to see how much you know.\nDoes that sound good to you?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Scouting_Sar_m01_015: <ICA>Agree.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Scouting_Sar_m01_016: <ICB>Decline.
