MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_ScoutingNo_Sar_m01_001: Oh, well, that's too bad. I hope to see you around.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_ScoutingNo_Sar_m01_002: Oh, well, that's too bad. I hope to see you around.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m01_001: Then let's get started. First question!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m01_002: Then let's get started. First question!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m01_003: I've heard Alecto is a great city that trades with\nports all over the world.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m01_004: I've heard Alecto is a great city that trades with\nports all over the world.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m01_005: I'd love to see Alecto someday. Do you know where\nit's located?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m01_006: I'd love to see Alecto someday. Do you know where\nit's located?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m01_007: <ICA>Guess the Dagdan Empire.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m01_008: <ICB>Guess Arago.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m01_009: <ICC>Guess Saramis.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m02_001: That's right! Of course you'd know where it is.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m02_002: That's right! Of course you'd know where it is.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m02_003: I think my question was too easy. Let's try another!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m02_004: I think my question was too easy. Let's try another!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m02_005: There is a town in Dagda known for the making of\nhigh-quality weapons.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m02_006: There is a town in Dagda known for the making of\nhigh-quality weapons.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m02_007: The weapons are even named after the town itself.\nCan you tell me what the town is called?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m02_008: The weapons are even named after the town itself.\nCan you tell me what the town is called?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m02_009: <ICA>Guess Da Mina.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m02_010: <ICB>Guess Callianeira Port.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m02_011: <ICC>Guess Pandora.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m03_001: Correct! Maybe that one was too easy as well?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m03_002: Correct! Maybe that one was too easy as well?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m03_003: OK, one last question!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m03_004: OK, one last question!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m03_005: Do you know of Bran Narrows in the east? Do you\nknow what's on that reef?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m03_006: Do you know of Bran Narrows in the east? Do you\nknow what's on that reef?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m03_007: It's huge, and there are stories of treasure hidden\nwithin. What is it?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m03_008: It's huge, and there are stories of treasure hidden\nwithin. What is it?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m03_009: <ICA>Guess a glass mountain.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m03_010: <ICB>Guess a grounded ship.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m03_011: <ICC>Guess a tower that reaches the heavens.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m04_001: You got all of the questions right! It seems like I can\nlearn a lot from you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m04_002: You got all of the questions right! It seems like I can\nlearn a lot from you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m04_003: Since you answered my questions, I'll keep my\npromise and fight alongside you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m04_004: Since you answered my questions, I'll keep my\npromise and fight alongside you.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m04_005: I admit I'm worried about leaving Anatolia, but I\nthink this experience will help me protect her.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m04_006: I admit I'm worried about leaving Anatolia, but I\nthink this experience will help me protect her.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m04_007: I look forward to working with you! Just don't let me\ndown, OK?
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Correct_Sar_m04_008: I look forward to working with you! Just don't let me\ndown, OK?
