MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Incorrect_Sar_m01_002: Oh, you got it wrong. That's too bad!
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Incorrect_Sar_m01_003: I selfishly hoped you'd be the one to help me.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Incorrect_Sar_m01_004: I selfishly hoped you'd be the one to help me.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Incorrect_Sar_m01_005: Goodbye for now. But please come back after you've\nstudied a bit.
MID_LGV_Scout_Negotiation_SP_Incorrect_Sar_m01_006: Goodbye for now. If you get a chance, please feel\nfree to invite me again.